%% Phase3 / schedule / G-09 取消定时消息
%% Helix owners: ws/handlers/post_schedule_canceled.rs; channel/write/schedule.rs; port_reply/message_v3_schedule.rs; event/schedule.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  Note over UI,IM: 前置：creator 已有 durable scheduled row；observer 不持有 scheduleId/取消权限。
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: cancelSchedule(channelId)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_cancel_schedule", {channelId})
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_cancel_schedule", {channelId})
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_cancel_schedule", {channelId})
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 从 session 派生 owner，查 schedule prerequisite
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist Get current schedule
  Host->>DB: read schedule by tenant/channel
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(schedule row)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST cancel schedule
  Host->>Go: HTTP schedule cancel
  Go-->>Host: 2xx admission（仍等待 authority）
  Go-->>WS: WS post_schedule_canceled(schedule,event_seq)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post_schedule_canceled)
  E->>IM: dispatch cancellation authority
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(remove/canceled schedule + cursor)
  Host->>DB: commit canceled state and cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk/PersistErr)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  alt cancel committed
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet schedule/channel
    Host->>DB: readback no active schedule
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:channel:schedule-canceled(creator view)
    Sink-->>UI: Angular removes scheduled projection
    Sink-->>FFI: batch raw canceled event
    Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw canceled event
  else late create or duplicate
    IM->>IM: monotonic cursor rejects stale create; no schedule resurrection
  end
  Note over UI,Web: 编辑定时消息是 cancel 后再 create 的两条独立 command；不合成 Angular 中间态。取消与到点竞态需以唯一 durable 终态为准。
